WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.232
The prince rushed toward Star. "Are you okay?"

2
00:00:07.233 --> 00:00:11.184
"Yes," Star said. "But—"

3
00:00:11.185 --> 00:00:14.331
Someone gasped.

4
00:00:14.332 --> 00:00:22.737
"Snow White! She's breathing!" Star shouted.

5
00:00:22.738 --> 00:00:25.395
The prince looked down.

6
00:00:25.396 --> 00:00:30.196
Inside the coffin was a beautiful girl.

7
00:00:30.197 --> 00:00:33.037
The prince threw open the coffin's lid.

8
00:00:33.038 --> 00:00:36.765
He helped Snow White to her feet.

9
00:00:36.766 --> 00:00:39.747
"Thank you, sir," Snow White said.

10
00:00:39.748 --> 00:00:48.526
The prince couldn't stop staring at her.

11
00:00:48.527 --> 00:00:53.164
The other dwarfs rushed over.

12
00:00:53.165 --> 00:00:58.736
"Hooray!" Dar cried.

13
00:00:58.737 --> 00:01:02.027
Gar picked up a piece of apple.

14
00:01:02.028 --> 00:01:04.907
"Be careful!" Snow White cried.

15
00:01:04.908 --> 00:01:06.940
"That apple is poisoned.

16
00:01:06.941 --> 00:01:09.891
It was stuck in my throat.

17
00:01:09.892 --> 00:01:12.396
Something knocked it out."

18
00:01:12.397 --> 00:01:16.651
Star blushed. "I knocked the coffin over.

19
00:01:16.652 --> 00:01:21.230
It was an accident."

20
00:01:21.231 --> 00:01:23.599
Snow White hugged him.

21
00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:34.348
"You saved my life, Star!"

22
00:01:34.349 --> 00:01:37.798
The prince was already in love with the young woman.

23
00:01:37.799 --> 00:01:41.666
"What happened to you?" he asked.

24
00:01:41.667 --> 00:01:49.493
Snow White told him about the queen.

25
00:01:49.494 --> 00:01:52.491
The prince dropped to one knee.

26
00:01:52.492 --> 00:01:56.890
"That evil woman cannot hurt you now," he said.

27
00:01:56.891 --> 00:02:14.123
"Please . . . Marry me!"

28
00:02:14.124 --> 00:02:20.548
The whole kingdom was invited to the wedding.

29
00:02:20.549 --> 00:02:25.031
When the queen arrived, she looked around.

30
00:02:25.032 --> 00:02:28.372
"Who is the bride?" she said.

31
00:02:28.373 --> 00:02:34.986
Then she saw her.

32
00:02:34.987 --> 00:02:39.875
"No! Not Snow White!"

33
00:02:39.876 --> 00:02:46.054
The queen stomped out of the wedding.

34
00:02:46.055 --> 00:02:54.284
Soon she moved to a faraway kingdom.

35
00:02:54.285 --> 00:02:58.317
But Snow White and the prince stayed right there.

36
00:02:58.318 --> 00:03:04.492
And lived happily ever after.

